// Glyth Snapshot API — zero-dependency Node server.
// Security model:
//  - DEMO_MODE=true (default): a single explicit demo workspace on localhost.
//    Demo bypass is deliberate and cannot silently become production behaviour:
//    DEMO_MODE=false without Supabase Auth configuration fails at startup.
//  - DEMO_MODE=false: consumer routes require a Supabase access token, the
//    user is derived from that token (never from the request body), and each
//    user gets an isolated state. Employer/bridge write routes stay gated.
// Secrets are server-side only; .env is never served (static allowlist).
